Nested Loop Left Join
  Output: t1.f1
  Join Filter: (t1.f1 = '***'::text)
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a19_t t1
        Output: t1.f1
  ->  Materialize
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a19_i8 i8b1
