>   ON (t1.f1 = b1.d1)
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Left Join
  Output: t1.f1, i8.q2
  Join Filter: (t1.f1 = '***'::text)
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a19_t t1
        Output: t1.f1
  ->  Materialize
        Output: i8.q2
        ->  Hash Right Join
              Output: i8.q2
              Hash Cond: (i8.q1 = i8b1.q2)
              ->  Seq Scan on public.a19_i8 i8
                    Output: i8.q1, i8.q2
              ->  Hash
                    Output: i8b1.q2
                    ->  Seq Scan on public.a19_i8 i8b1
                          Output: i8b1.q2
-- EXPLAIN

